  "content": "[Intro]\n[E7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[E7]Ev'ry night I just wanna\ngo out, Get out of my\n[E7sus2]head.\n[E7]Ev'ry day I don't wanna\nget up, Get out of my\n[E7sus2]bed.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[A]Ev'ry night [F#m]I want to\n[Bm]play out\n[F#7]And ev'ry day I wanna\n[B]dooohoohooh-\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]ooh. But tonight I just wanna\nstay in And be with you\n[F#m]oo,\n[B7]And be with you.\n\n[Break]\n[E]\n\n[Interlude]\n[E]Oohoohoohoohoohoohooh-\n[A]oohooh,\n[E]Oohooh\n[B7]ooh ooh.\n[E]Oohoohoohoohoohoohooh-\n[A]oohooh,\n[E]Oohooh\n[B7]oohooh.\n[E7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E7]Ev'ry day I lean on a\nlamp post, I'm wasting my time.\n[E7sus2]\n[E7]Ev'ry night I lay on a\npillow, I'm resting my mind.\n[E7sus2]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[A]Ev'ry mor [F#m]ning brings a\n[Bm]new day\n[F#7]And ev'ry night that day is\n[B]through.\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]But tonight I just wanna\nstay in And be with you,\n[F#m]\n[B7]And be with you.\n\n[Break]\n[E]\n\n[Interlude]\n[E]Oohoohoohoohoohoohooh-\n[A]oohooh,\n[E]Oohooh\n[B7]oohooh, believe me, momma.\n[E]Oohoohoohoohoohooh ooh -\n[A]oohooh, momma,\n[E]Oohooh\n[B7]oohooh.\n\n[Outro]\n[E]Oohoohoohooh........\n[A]\n[E]\n[B7]",
